m:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_XHdlr-1ptkm9ZzHvIuxSmw" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtTextBlock" id="Tb_k8RmPZD1xkG-QdiNc5UrHA" continuedAt="Tb_k8RmPZD1xkG-QdiNc5UrHA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">6</b><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">.</b></span>Long &#8211; Term Obligations</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Senior Secured Term Loan</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In March 2026, the Company entered into the Loan Agreement with <span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">the Collateral Agent, BPCR Limited Partnership and BioPharma Credit Investments V (Master) LP,</span> <span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">which are funds managed by</span> Pharmakon and the guarantors party thereto. The Loan Agreement provides for a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanMember_rTabmgtLUkCvDfroRffKmw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" id="Narr_6eGbZXs07kCj8qtDT0lZKw">five-year</ix:nonNumeric> senior secured term loan, which matures on March 27, 2031 (&#8220;Term Loan Maturity Date&#8221;), for up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanMember_QUbnfgm7UkG9N4VH996ZhA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_fTd6dH8fAEqQjJXqz-giFQ">250.0</ix:nonFraction> million and consists of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_tranche_kulIQRVm-EKjm36CEhEJRA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanMember_QUbnfgm7UkG9N4VH996ZhA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentNumberOfTranches" scale="0" id="Narr_gpGS5LSgQ0ylxQ0BrXeGAg">five</ix:nonFraction> tranches (collectively, the &#8220;Term Loans&#8221;). <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_tranche_kulIQRVm-EKjm36CEhEJRA" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanMember_rTabmgtLUkCvDfroRffKmw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentNumberOfCommittedTranches" scale="0" id="Narr_tmjZLD7aP0Syo00r1AOEbw">Two</ix:nonFraction> of the tranches are committed tranches: (i) Tranche A in an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheTermLoanMember_y2Ukx3XHP0-9zgNDI4HtgQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_Lnd0hnQQ5kGylf6rCOjdYQ">75.0</ix:nonFraction> million, which was funded on the date the Loan Agreement was executed; and (ii) Tranche B in an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheBTermLoanMember_i9UWyT_-V0me71DIKcO-iA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_4na7VjROkEy3eQAJpjpDpg">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million (and up to an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheBTermLoanMember_i9UWyT_-V0me71DIKcO-iA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentMaximumAdditionalBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_elSImeYuTEaVsreWNjD9UA">25.0</ix:nonFraction> million that the Company may elect to draw), which is available until November 1, 2027, subject to the occurrence of certain approval conditions (the &#8220;Tranche B/C Approval Condition&#8221;). </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_tranche_kulIQRVm-EKjm36CEhEJRA" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanMember_rTabmgtLUkCvDfroRffKmw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentNumberOfDiscretionalTranches" scale="0" id="Narr_NYUbfVmc8kSqx490gWBqBg">Three</ix:nonFraction> of the tranches may be drawn upon at the discretion of the Company: (i) Tranche C in an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheCTermLoanMember_Wlvp8YPO-UqTO4R5uOnmuw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_rBNYesDMRk6DfrooN1QZdQ">25.0</ix:nonFraction> million (less any amounts elected to be (and actually) drawn under Tranche B in excess of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheBTermLoanMember_i9UWyT_-V0me71DIKcO-iA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_7rfNTedu70y-Be7APC650g">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million), which is available until April 28, 2028; (ii) Tranche D in an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheDTermLoanMember_GwTN2CXnVUumJVY1ohrTug" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_8ueSgb7pBEiJuyK72rw7pw">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million, which is available until October 30, 2028; and (iii) Tranche E in an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheETermLoanMember_8fdX1qRTLUOej43_S_YKSA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_YKsGdLpR8UyZ_mIn3E0SjQ">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million, which is available until April 30, 2029. Tranche C through E are subject to the occurrence of certain approval conditions and achievements of certain milestones in respect of certain net sales levels. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Loan Agreement bears interest at annual interest rate of 3-month <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_bmbDjHd7Y0qsNX4xCVs-dg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">secured overnight financing rate</span></span> (&#8220;SOFR&#8221;) subject to a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanMember_QUbnfgm7UkG9N4VH996ZhA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_k4jeVfWSmEaz20LNlcMcyA">3.25</ix:nonFraction>% floor, plus <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanMember_rTabmgtLUkCvDfroRffKmw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_cPxSp70euUCogjaeze6Sxw">5.75</ix:nonFraction>% payable quarterly in arrears. The Company may elect for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_zbio_ScenarioPeriodOfFirst24MonthsFollowingTrancheLoanFundingDateMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanMember_kOk-fChJUky1cC0E6w4q_g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:PercentageOfInterestToBePaidInKind" scale="-2" id="Narr_Ec_LhAU7VE22I3XbE_VyAg">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the interest for the first 24 months following the Tranche A Loan funding date to be paid-in-kind (&#8220;PIK Interest&#8221;) without an increase in the interest rate.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company is required to pay a funding fee equal to (i) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheTermLoanMember_U7IX8IfEe0O23uCSwQJbsA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentFundingFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Uk3l7xX8HUetFuBUB9Gvfw">2.00</ix:nonFraction>% of the funding amount of the Tranche A on the funding date of such loan, (ii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheBTermLoanMember_ONvOPpGOAES_d9R6ZJRWvw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentFundingFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_TswaZJnq3EKaBJqc_Hu_LA">2.00</ix:nonFraction>% of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheBTermLoanMember_i9UWyT_-V0me71DIKcO-iA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_7rnAGkbVgEKHrRSzesICfg">50,000,000</ix:nonFraction> of the funding amount of the Tranche B on the funding date for such loan, (iii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheCTermLoanMember_IF93oh0WxkSh_TXl1ui5Bw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentFundingFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_R3Jc3u8QfkWwkTCCnyEGzw">1.00</ix:nonFraction>% of any amounts in excess of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheBTermLoanMember_i9UWyT_-V0me71DIKcO-iA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_IZ3zmdmwfUejQNy8JHr0xA">50,000,000</ix:nonFraction> of the funding amount for the Tranche B on the funding date for such loan, and (iv) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_SeniorSecuredTermLoanTrancheDTermLoanMember_cxXcpN93Z02-h38ULHwTWQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:DebtInstrumentFundingFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_WuztVSOzpEKMxywWsAgA3Q">1.00</ix:nonFraction>% of each of the funding amount of the Tranche C, Tranche D, and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_EuWEQVC2fUajVQoTQ5yWQA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Tranche E</span></span> on each respective funding 