aap:CollaborativeArrangementDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb__LWjiCDzhE6V_vTutul5Yg" continuedAt="Tb__LWjiCDzhE6V_vTutul5Yg_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">7</span><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">.</b></span>License and Collaboration Revenue</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">License and Collaboration Agreement with Bristol-Myers Squibb</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In August&#160;2023, the Company entered into a license and collaboration agreement (the &#8220;BMS Agreement&#8221;) with Bristol-Myers Squibb (&#8220;BMS&#8221;), under which the Company granted BMS an exclusive license to (i)&#160;develop, manufacture (subject to the Company&#8217;s rights to be the exclusive manufacturer for BMS for a certain period of time), commercialize or otherwise exploit obexelimab and any biological product (irrespective of presentations, formulations or dosages) containing obexelimab but not any of the Company&#8217;s other proprietary active ingredient (the &#8220;BMS Product&#8221;) into Japan, South Korea, Taiwan, Singapore, Hong Kong and Australia (collectively, the &#8220;BMS Territory&#8221;) and (ii)&#160;develop and manufacture obexelimab and the BMS Product outside the BMS Territory provided that obexelimab and the BMS Product are solely used in the BMS Territory. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Pursuant to the BMS Agreement, BMS paid the Company a one-time non-refundable upfront cash payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_8_1_2023_To_8_31_2023_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_jIRBFIYo90-KvGoXUB3BOg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeArrangementUpfrontPaymentReceived" scale="6" id="Narr_FQS5m06fIk6hsq5E7KEFxA">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million. The Company is entitled to receive further separate development, regulatory milestone payments from BMS of up to approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_YQ7KtaBIKE2R3Jc6AAwT7w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeArrangementDevelopmentRegulatoryAndSalesMilestonePaymentsReceivableMaximum" scale="6" id="Narr_qH2IKxPiM0uwqp33Mhbgzw">79.5</ix:nonFraction> million. The Company is also entitled to receive one-time sales milestone payments up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_8_31_2023_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_YQ7KtaBIKE2R3Jc6AAwT7w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeArrangementSalesMilestonePaymentsReceivableMaximum" scale="6" id="Narr_FukMYKN5H0aneFK9CKtWEg">70.0</ix:nonFraction> million upon BMS achieving certain net sales milestones in a given year in the BMS Territory. The Company is also eligible to receive tiered high single-digit to low double-digit royalties on net sales in the BMS Territory, subject to specified reductions. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company will continue to perform and oversee the ongoing Phase 3 trial of obexelimab in the immunoglobulin G4-related disease (&#8220;IgG4-RD&#8221;) indication and BMS will participate in the performance of the study. BMS will fund their pro rata share of the total global study costs up to a specified&#160;percentage of the patients enrolled in the study from the BMS Territory. The global development activities under the agreement do not represent a transaction with a customer and reimbursement payments received by the Company for global development activities are accounted for as a reduction of the related research and development expenses. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company recorded $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_sx-c_PPIHUqXxnwG7oB5Cg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeArrangementReceivables" scale="6" id="Narr_Y7D9cdvOLkaQsSz4tV495w">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_x1Bhmp-wt06JxG_ZyoC8Gg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeArrangementReceivables" scale="6" id="Narr_tVc-8t9PZE-_xInrStmidg">1.3</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, as a receivable included in prepaid expenses and other current assets. The Company recorded $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_1mB8IEexX02zlptctO8gSA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesReimbursed" scale="6" id="Narr_7URJzK55rkOla4jd3vDddg">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_fkxSwQJY_EOOffG14fiIUA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesReimbursed" scale="6" id="Narr_wUGE8WI9oUql57Q2YBfj2g">1.3</ix:nonFraction> million for the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_ujBWrsxMKE2t5IGH7AYrgg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesReimbursed" scale="6" id="Narr_I5KyrftDREWkjSr2vZJU2Q">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_u5KjKlreq0aizGl55XYcWg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesReimbursed" scale="6" id="Narr_xhXkg7uSnEWBBrrDLWvB3Q">3.0</ix:nonFraction> million for the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively, as a reduction to research and development expense for global development costs to be reimbursed by BMS. The Company did <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_u5KjKlreq0aizGl55XYcWg" decimals="-5" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_RAHKnHPSckyAV79wMHWOYA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithBristolMyersSquibbMember_fkxSwQJY_EOOffG14fiIUA" decimals="-5" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Na