n> shares of common stock to InnoCare upon the achievement of a specified development milestone related to Zenas&#8217; Phase 3 clinical trial for orelabrutinib in any indication other than primary progressive MS, or by March 31, 2026, upon the occurrence of certain specified events, whichever comes first (the &#8220;Near-term Milestone&#8221;). In addition, the Company has agreed to make one-time, potential near-term milestone payments of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_a38wL_zz70-Tzspd450fQg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeAgreementNearTermMilestonePaymentsPayable" scale="6" id="Narr_e5ltmpBGTkaFKyn-Gu4mYg">20.0</ix:nonFraction> million each, upon the achievement of certain regulatory milestones for ZB021 and ZB022 (the &#8220;Regulatory Milestones&#8221;). During the three months ended June 30, 2026, the Company achieved the ZB021 Regulatory Milestone and made a payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_jRtWa6TbU0CqTgd6WxGrBA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeAgreementRegulatoryMilestonePayments" scale="6" id="Narr_0Ceon_ehIE6cUasrRINOAA">20.0</ix:nonFraction> million, which was recorded as acquired in-process research and development expense.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;">The Company is further obligated to pay future regulatory and commercial milestones of up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_a38wL_zz70-Tzspd450fQg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeAgreementFutureRegulatoryAndCommercialMilestonePaymentsPayable" scale="6" id="Narr_yqK20iB4C0yaULKiUOnowA">723.0</ix:nonFraction> million related to orelabrutinib, and future development, regulatory, and commercial milestones of up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_a38wL_zz70-Tzspd450fQg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeAgreementFutureDevelopmentRegulatoryAndCommercialMilestone" scale="6" id="Narr_Qq1r8KIHkUyJfu_0eXt0UA">636.0</ix:nonFraction> million for ZB021, and $656.0 million for ZB022, inclusive of the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2025_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_a38wL_zz70-Tzspd450fQg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:CollaborativeAgreementRegulatoryMilestonePaymentsPayable" scale="6" id="Narr_ZoTIvCWQ6UqPBs9SZYjZng">20.0</ix:nonFraction> million Regulatory Milestone for ZB022 specified above, if certain milestones are successfully achieved. In addition, the Company is obligated to pay royalties on net sales at rates ranging from high-single digits to high-teens for orelabrutinib, and mid-single digits to mid-teens for the preclinical compounds. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Under the InnoCare License Agreement, the Company is obligated to reimburse InnoCare for certain clinical trial startup costs and Investigational New Drug (&#8220;IND&#8221;) enabling activities which were incurred prior to and after the effective date of the agreement. During the three and six months ended June 30, 2026, the Company incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_jRtWa6TbU0CqTgd6WxGrBA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:LicenseAndOptionAgreementsContractManufacturingOrganizationCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_1pEJ6kCxpE6NVz0x9f80Og">0.7</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_k5q1B6RSzUiyczmheKaMwg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:LicenseAndOptionAgreementsContractManufacturingOrganizationCosts" scale="6" id="Narr_7TvthFtkWEmJEXNgxj09eg">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million of expense, respectively. During the three and six months ended June 30, 2026, the Company made payments of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_jRtWa6TbU0CqTgd6WxGrBA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:LicenseAndOptionAgreementsReimbursableExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_VlZ39C3zGkGjBh46ssstmg">1.4</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_zbio_LicenseAgreementWithInnocarePharmaIncMember_k5q1B6RSzUiyczmheKaMwg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:LicenseAndOptionAgreementsReimbursableExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_SX04ntun-0GoOs911_lxYg">2.2</ix:nonFraction> million to InnoCare related to the acquired programs, respectively. </p></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_XHdlr-1ptkm9ZzHvIuxSmw" name="us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_X7GslFRx30mlOCJDV7Ebcw" continuedAt="Tb_X7GslFRx30mlOCJDV7Ebcw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">9.</b></span>Royalty Obligation</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:14pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">In September 2025, the Company and Royalty Pharma entered into the Royalty Purchase Agreement. Pursuant to the Royalty Purchase Agreement, the Company received a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_-TsxxLygDE62OQHDDbms_g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_nMuEqtgoTUGpDYtQ8pAXkw">75.0</ix:nonFraction> million upfront payment in exchange for which Royalty Pharma purchased the right to receive, for each calendar quarter, (i) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_-TsxxLygDE62OQHDDbms_g" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:PercentageOfRoyaltyOnNetSales" scale="-2" id="Narr_aqno0K7eeU6mMoL4F8cDuA">5.5</ix:nonFraction>%<span style="background:#ffffff;"> of net sales of obexelimab products sold by the Company and its affiliates worldwide, (ii)&#160;</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_-TsxxLygDE62OQHDDbms_g" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:PercentageOfRoyaltyOnNetSalesByLicensees" scale="-2" id="Narr_uX-Lp2L1E028L8KE6B41lA">5.5</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> of net sales of obexelimab products sold by licensees of Zenas and its affiliates in the U.S., the United Kingdom and the European Union, (iii)&#160;</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_-TsxxLygDE62OQHDDbms_g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:PercentageOfRoyaltyOnIncomeEarnedFromLicensees" scale="-2" id="Narr_p9ykMW0Uokm2RrcBHPeXLQ">25</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> of royalty income payable to Zenas or any of its affiliates on sales of obexelimab products in countries other than the U.S., the United Kingdom, and in the European Union by its licensees pursuant to out-licenses less royalty payments payable by Zenas to Xencor Inc. and (iv)&#160;</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_-2mt7jRrJ0CUiod0xhaTYg" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2025_To_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_-TsxxLygDE62OQHDDbms_g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:PercentageOfRoyaltyOnNonRoyaltyIncomeEarnedFromLicensees" scale="-2" id="Narr_wToePp8C6k-GWpULjpEHYA">25</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> of non-royalty income attributable to obexelimab products payable to Zenas or any of its affiliates by its licensees (other than certain milestone payments payable by Bristol-Myers Squibb) pursuant to out-licenses and allocated to countries other than the U.S., the United Kingdom and in the European Union.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:14pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">The Royalty Purchase Agreement provides for an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_KiwYtS88dU-yPzPAO89cTQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:RoyaltyContingentMilestonePaymentsReceivable" scale="6" id="Narr_FNJFKt_JsEmSN8T59Ck9LA">225.0</ix:nonFraction> million of payments to be paid to the Company by Royalty Pharma upon the occurrence of certain triggering events which includes (1) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_zbio_Phase3TrialMilestoneMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_0bp8POuoXku1dwqAKvO8XQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:RoyaltyContingentMilestonePaymentsReceivable" scale="6" id="Narr_HoFdd8pI4kqbnQaXjlMusw">75.0</ix:nonFraction> million payable upon the achievement of certain milestones with respect to Zenas&#8217; INDIGO Phase 3 Trial, noting the Company is not currently eligible for this milestone, (2)&#160;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_zbio_FoodAndDrugAdministrationApprovalForIgg4RelatedDiseaseMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_Sxpd-x3HU0-WRGczw5rrWQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:RoyaltyContingentMilestonePaymentsReceivable" scale="6" id="Narr_ycTIih3jmkW7UFi5d6xQMQ">75.0</ix:nonFraction> million payable following receipt of marketing approval for obexelimab from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (the &#8220;FDA&#8221;) for the treatment of IgG4-Related Disease on or before a specified date and (3)&#160;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_a7NFRpLArEKNOdVcUT0vjw" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_zbio_FoodAndDrugAdministrationApprovalForSystemicLupusErythematosusMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_zbio_RoyaltyPurchaseAgreementMember_QSt00rGK7EysDMJi7MXsJg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zbio:RoyaltyContingentMilestonePaymentsReceivable" scale="6" id="Narr_88EiByueZEmg0HOa_UG6FQ">75.0</ix:nonFraction> million payable following receipt of marketing approval for obexelimab from the FDA for the treatment of systemic lupus erythematosus on or before a specified date.&#160;</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">23</p></div></div>
